@ProjectSem3_HostAddress = https://localhost:7274
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Liveness
GET {{ProjectSem3_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness (includes SQL Server)
GET {{ProjectSem3_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Register
POST {{ProjectSem3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "userName": "student",
  "password": "StrongPass!123"
}

### Login (the client keeps the Set-Cookie refresh token)
POST {{ProjectSem3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUserName": "user@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass!123"
}

### Current user
GET {{ProjectSem3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh access token
POST {{ProjectSem3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Admin: list users
GET {{ProjectSem3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
